{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>From male to female you shall send.</b> It does not say 'from man to woman' — this tells you that regarding impurity, adults and minors are equal." "<b>And they shall not defile their camps.</b> Since the Shekhinah is among them and they camp around the Tabernacle, they must purify their camps from impurity, and cleanse themselves of robbery and of suspected immorality such as the sotah, and observe naziriteship in purity."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:30.759973137Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}